.github
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/htmlcov
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log
/models
/data
/outputs
/tools
